{title: Grace Greater than Our Sin}
{artist: Julia Johnston & Daniel Towner}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 88}

Verse 1
[G]Marvelous grace of our [C]loving [G]Lord, grace that exceeds our [A]sin and our [D]guilt —
[G]yonder on Calvary's [C]mount out[G]poured, there where the [D]blood of the [G]Lamb was spilt.

Chorus
[G]Grace, grace, [C]God's [G]grace, grace that will pardon [A]and cleanse with[D]in;
[G]grace, grace, [C]God's [G]grace, grace that is greater [D]than all our [G]sin!
